  "instructions": [
    "heat a large skillet over medium-high heat, with a few pieces of binchotan charcoal",
    "add the chopped onion and cook until lightly browned",
    "add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute",
    "add the chipotle peppers, cumin, lime juice, salt, and black pepper, stir to combine",
    "add the kidney beans and cook for 2-3 minutes",
    "warm the tortillas by wrapping them in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20-30 seconds",
    "assemble the tacos by spooning the bean mixture onto a tortilla and topping with chopped cilantro"
